        <mxCell id="VGzQ5WbKVkpj-qibjkLq-446" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;labelBorderColor=default;" value="&amp;nbsp; 1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Views PR list submitted by &lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Depot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; or &lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Feed mill&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; 2. Created &lt;b&gt;Transport Request (TR)&lt;/b&gt; and Defines:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Quantity of Finished goods to be transferred (Bags &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;/ cartons)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Source &amp;amp; Destination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Delivery Date&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Expected quantity of &lt;b&gt;Vehicles&lt;/b&gt; required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Expected &lt;b&gt;Vehicle type &lt;/b&gt;(6 Wheeler/12 Wheeler)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Urgency&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="62" width="308" x="3571" y="2160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VGzQ5WbKVkpj-qibjkLq-447" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;labelBorderColor=default;" value="&amp;nbsp; 1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;TDO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Views TO list (Vendor Fleet) submitted with the transport requirement&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; 2.&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;TDO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Decides Contractual Vendor or Non-Contractual Vendor (Bidding)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- If&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Contractual Vendor&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;TDO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;based on &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;route,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;assign single or multiple&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;Vendor(s)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;individual TOs for trip execution with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;partial &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;quantity allocation for each vendors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- These vendors do not need to input price &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;rate for bidding (Price will be saved in BE based &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;contract, not visible to Contractual vendors)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- If&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Non-Contractual Vendor&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;TDO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Submits TO &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Rate for bidding:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- After receiving bids,&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;TDO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;can select&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;the &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;winning vendor for trip&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Vendors needs to input &lt;b&gt;Price&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;and &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Number of vehicles available &lt;/b&gt;in &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;vendor&#39;s end&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="62" width="292" x="3294" y="2722" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
