l TOs&amp;nbsp;for trip execution with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;partial quantity &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;allocation for each vendors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- These vendors do not need to input price rate &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;for bidding (Price will be saved in BE based &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;contract, not visible to Contractual vendors)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- If&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Non-Contractual Vendor&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;TDO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Submits &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;TO&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Rate for bidding:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- After receiving bids,&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(102, 102, 255);&quot;&gt;TDO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;can &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;select&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;the&amp;nbsp;winning vendor for trip&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Vendors needs to &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;input&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Price&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Number of vehicles &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;available&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;in vendor&#39;s end&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
